<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve</p>
<p>announced average interest rates for the week ended April 25,</p>
<p>compared with the April 18 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.48 vs 5.48</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............5.19 vs 5.16</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.70 vs 5.71</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.63 vs 5.62</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.71 vs 5.72</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.70 vs 5.70</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............7.10 vs 7.10</p>
</text>
